    {
      "uid": "zhcn:199af665b01cfca1ccdb77be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那样的话，身为圣女的我，\n也会用希望之光照亮记者先生的心灵。\n就凭我拿下BC胜利的那一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3836a0a266d309f2384617c55fdb9591dcd94e70f45274bf2a102c07bd9167e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
