        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b56110b02303cd78d3ac0ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两年半后吗。对于这位圣女故事的结局，\n稍微……开始变得期待了。\n……期待到让我都想为你加油了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2756f98a6ac5fd467dccff182bd8e515f9bbe5aa7918cfc76d01b097f5fdf5a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013004.json",
      "json_path": [
