    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:897b3c6218b73a9664970235",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，辛苦了！\n正好刚才在和那位记者先生谈话。\n谈论挑战BC是多么具有意义的一件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2f0afc8a2b3d8f75d09bd9bbd317d01f93c5eefc437c732b4d5d87db463ec94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14e661d98725602b4330e8fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来她的养成方针要以心理层面为重心呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3dc26a78ef243d3d0e1b95e45ca0b7fe39b3c6eda1f1bcf0504e1df4a22a0a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b258ef5aea6edbf0863c2d2f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然有稍微有些操之过急的倾向，但她展现出\n的天赋也是可圈可点。只要控制好干劲，\n应该还能有大幅度的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9b74d6a52367b5142730622c572ac3e2cd7ba2d3bf64f08b3e777551e817cdc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36b629841d28cffa13a68202",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想必这份心意也传达给那位记者了吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "975a6a31f9a295bbd4b2ddac494c0cf3153d98b53fd68a25e46294ad30c9970f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
