    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dc094efcb839132ac6706d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。我也如此相信。\n关于我有资格挑战BC这一点，\n想必他一定理解了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8703a3b3b288113a4d703254547994182731bf0874d0dc61414fb8bc78ea06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
