      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想你所渴望的“那片土地”——\n一定也就在那前方……我也是这么认为的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7284b773dcfd9bb982f21ec9e3bb6ad8ae7f194c47758e2d59d5a0c04cfeb6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1bd0f059f8cb5eb6f1eb5d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，为了开创那条道路，我们都在这里",
      "source_fingerprint": "35a52e16146c39a4206b0f5d80eac4f796e7661e1c8da6b9672b5a4b3750a379",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
